{"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/SelectiveSemiring","doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/Semiring","doc:\/\/Semirings\/SL","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/SQ","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/SH","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Semirings\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tropical semiring (min, +) over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Value"},{"type":"text","text":", for shortest paths (Mohri). This is the min-plus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"form."}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"TropicalSemiring","remoteSource":{"fileName":"TropicalSemiring.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Semirings\/TropicalSemiring.swift#L19"},"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TropicalSemiring"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TropicalSemiring","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:9Semirings16TropicalSemiringV","modules":[{"name":"Semirings"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/semirings\/tropicalsemiring"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Semirings\/documentation\/Semirings\/TropicalSemiring"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TropicalSemiring"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","t